usage: plan.py artifact [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--inline]
                        [--repo NAME=PATH]
                        plan ref

read artifact metadata and optional content (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  ref

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --inline
  --repo NAME=PATH
